      "objective": "Explain what Ohm’s law says, how voltage pushes current through a resistance, and how to use U = R × I with real numbers.",
      "prerequisites": [
        "Voltage as a push, like a battery",
        "Current as a flow of charge in a wire",
        "Resistance as how strongly a component blocks the flow"
